'''Eradjian''' (ᨇᨑᨆᨉᨍᨈ, ''eradji'', <small>pronounced</small> [əradʒi]) is a [[Haynadurian languages|Haynadurian language]] within the [[Paharian language family]], and is written in the [[Haynadurian script]]<!--Lontara script-->. It is primarily spoken in [[Haynadur]] by the [[Eradjian people]] and serves as one of the four co-official languages of the country, as well as the language of the [[Eradjian diaspora]] around Basis. 

